  "description": "Azure Blob Storage REST (x-ms-version 2026-06-06). Official API https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/rest/api/storageservices/blob-service-rest-api. One node; pick operation. Upload/download/convert/sign payloads use type file (Platform file ref-id (sq-file: / sq-ref:gridfs:). Never inline bytes or base64 as the stored type.) Handler: OfficialApiNode + api_spec.json. Default x-ms-version 2026-06-06. Block blobs for upload. OfficialApiNode does not compute SharedKey; prefer SAS on the request URL. Errors raise a BPMN error for the error boundary event (INVALID_INPUT, AUTH_FAILED, RATE_LIMITED, HTTP_<status>, REQUEST_FAILED); secrets are redacted.",
